# Owned by agent-standards and kept by tools/update_quality_tools.py, which replaces only crapper, dryer and mutator.
# It travels with the tools, so a project without line-ending rules of its own still checks the launchers out right.

# cmd.exe misreads a label in a batch file with bare LF endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# sh reads a CR at the end of a line as part of the command.
/run text eol=lf

# Robert C. Martin's tools and the wrapper are not this project's code, so GitHub leaves them out of its language
# statistics and collapses them in diffs.
* linguist-vendored
